                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm pleased to see the House pass the Youth Poisoning and Protection Act today. This was one of the first bills I cosponsored in Congress because, at home in Utah, I've seen our teens struggle with mental health. Suicide is the leading cause of death for Utahns ages 10-17, and this legislation will help protect our kids from greater harm.",
