                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently met with Enterprise Mayor Brandon Humphries and Councilman Roy Adams to discuss drinking water infrastructure and watershed health. Good water policy is critical for rural small towns like Enterprise and it continues to be a top priority for me. https://t.co/2xXaQqPTIQ",
