                "text": "BLM's so-called \u201cConservation and Landscape Health\u201d rule is illegal and locks out Utahns who have relied on the land for generations. The WEST Act is about responsible multiple use and making sure agencies stay in their lane. Learn more about my bill with @RepRussFulcher here. \ud83d\udd17https://t.co/urP59ttB7k",
